- provide :title, "Gallery"
h1.mb-8.text-2xl.font-bold Gallery
/ The lightbox closes before Turbo caches the page, since a snapshot of an open modal would come
/ back as a non-modal dialog stuck open.
div data-controller="lightbox" data-action="turbo:before-cache@document->lightbox#close keydown.left@window->lightbox#previous keydown.right@window->lightbox#next"
  / Columns rather than a cropped grid: artworks keep their proportions, and the watermark
  / in their south-east corner stays visible.
  ul class="columns-2 gap-2 sm:columns-3"
    = render partial: "artwork", collection: @artworks
  - if @artworks.any?
    = render "lightbox", artworks: @artworks
